Subject: [PATCH 12/23] test(m8-stokes): add the R02 analytic scenes and the
 single-pixel transfer library

- change: model/blp_analytic reads a scene file ($RAPTOR_SCENE): the test_ray_orientation.jl slab and Faraday screen, the orientation-check prograde ring (fig_eht_bbh.jl), and the Gold et al. 2020 analytic emitter; thermal scenes decode BlackLightPlus primitives (primitive_four_vectors, plasma_decode) with the SKS metric
- change: EMIS_MODEL hook lets a model supply the transfer coefficients (model_evaluate_coeffs); on in model/blp_analytic for the Gold scene
- change: tests/pixel_rt.c (libraptor_rt_pol.so, libraptor_rt_unpol.so) returns the observed IQUV of one image point through integrate_geodesic and the polarized or unpolarized transfer
- next: R02 sign tests fix the camera Stokes readout (M8)
